      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Vertex AI on Google Cloud as the external provider. I'm focusing on the `generative-ai` model offered there, and now I'm making sure to concretely identify it in the `invoke_platform_model.py` code.\n\n\n**Implementing the Script**\n\nI'm now in the process of building `invoke_platform_model.py`. I'm integrating the Python code, focusing on incorporating the Vertex AI client and loading the \"gemini-pro\" model specifically. The code will initialize the client with the project and location and then attempt to generate content from the loaded model. I'm focusing on incorporating the right imports and ensuring proper provider-specific identifiers are in place.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887123788,
          "start": 1789887121491
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd960853001qE1EDfx6FZg2Zo",
